<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">ATTACHMENTS: Contact Sheet, Insperity Premier Contact Center
Brochure, Manager’s Quick Guide to NSP<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[&nbsp;</span></font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#181818">&lt;insert contact name&gt; </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span>
