<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hope you
are very well. As <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[&nbsp;</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Project
Manager Name <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></span><span style="color: red;">&nbsp;</span>mentioned, my name is {!User.Name},&nbsp;and I am your Insperity HR Specialist. My role
is to provide you with consultative recommendations on how to best maximize
Insperity’s services and coordinate and manage the delivery of our
services.<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; </span>I am available to help you
navigate the compliance landscape and provide guidance on people matters. <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">I would
like to request a few minutes of your time at your convenience to discuss your Insperity
relationship, your company goals and objectives, your service team, and how we
can best assist you.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>My availability is
below – please let me know what time works best for you, and I will send a
calendar invite.</span></font></p>

